WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
10 seconds left, keep those arms and legs moving.

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.400
And let it relax.

3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.880
All right, a full 20 seconds rest.

4
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.760
Keep those feet moving back and forth.

5
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.680
Just moving a little bit, nice deep breath in.

6
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.360
Try to get as much oxygen into those lungs

7
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.360
as you possibly can before we start into that next round.

8
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.200
Remember, we're cutting 10 seconds off again,

9
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.160
so we're down to 40 seconds for this round.

10
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.560
Restarting back in with those flutter kicks

11
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.400
here in just a second.

12
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.240
And start them up.

13
00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.680
Get those feet going, nice deep squats.

14
00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:31.800
Try to get as much range of motion on those legs as you can.

15
00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.560
I know those legs are burning like crazy.

16
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.200
They're completely tired.

17
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.880
But try to keep those legs moving.

18
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.800
Good quick motion with those kicks.

19
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.300
And a nice deep squat every single time.

20
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.280
And we are already halfway.

21
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.720
Got another 20 seconds left.

22
00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.040
Keep those feet moving, nice deep squats.

23
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:50.920
Keep those lungs open.

24
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.120
Make sure you're never holding your breath.

25
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.120
Almost done.
